* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˌpɑsəˈkɑljə/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|music genre}} {{def|A form of [[historical]] [[Spanish]] or [[Italian]] dance characterised by a serious nature, [[triple metre]], and use of a [[ground bass]].}}
# {{lb|en|music|by extension}} {{def|Any piece of [[classical music]] with similar characteristics.}}

